integer $h\ge0$,

$$
D_h=E^{\mathsf T}B^{-h},\qquad D_hB^hE=\mathrm{Id}_N.
\tag{105.4}
$$

A paid rational left inverse $L_O$ of (105.2) recovers any whole current
